# First-party wheels to install into the mdt image.
# One package name per line. Text after '#' is a comment.
# Resolved pre-build by scripts/resolve-devcontainers-release.py; wheels are
# downloaded into pip/wheels/ and installed via `pip install --no-index --find-links`.
#
# Format mirrors apt/packages.list: one entry per line, '#' starts a comment.
#
# Depends on <name>-latest GitHub Release existing at build time.
# The actual download is skipped (non-fatal warning) when no release is found;
# the first rebuild after cmru's P7 re-release will populate pip/wheels/.
#
# See: docs/plan-cmru-finish.md §2B (deferred build / cmru-latest dependency).

ciu   # https://github.com/volkb79-2/vbpub/releases — ciu-v* releases carry the wheel (deps Jinja2/PyYAML/tomli_w provided by requirements/toolkit.txt)
cmru  # https://github.com/volkb79-2/vbpub/releases — cmru-v* releases carry the wheel (no runtime deps)
nyxloom  # https://github.com/volkb79-2/vbpub/releases — nyxloom-v* releases carry the wheel (deps structlog/PyYAML/jsonschema provided by requirements/toolkit.txt)
topos  # https://github.com/volkb79-2/vbpub/releases — topos-v* releases carry the wheel (dep textual provided by requirements/toolkit.txt). CLI/client only (`topos --attach`, `topos daemon status|current`) — the root daemon itself needs host DAMON/debugfs/cgroup access this devcontainer does not mount and is not meant to run in a container (see topos/docs/DAEMON.md "Threat Model" + topos/README.md); it connects OUT to a daemon socket, it does not run one in here.
